# Topic contract (see stack/README.md):
#   phm/raw/<thing_id>/<feature_id>   high-rate samples  -> Telegraf -> InfluxDB
#   phm/state/<thing_id>              Ditto Protocol      -> Ditto (twin state)

# Edge adapters: publish only.
user edge
topic write phm/raw/#
topic write phm/state/#

# Ditto connectivity: twin state only.
user ditto
topic read phm/state/#

# Telegraf: raw samples only.
user telegraf
topic read phm/raw/#
